{"seq":1,"slug":"wasm-architecture","title":"WASM 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/core-concepts/wasm-architecture","wordCount":1149,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"wasm-架构\">WASM 架构</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>WebAssembly 的核心是一台<strong>栈式虚拟机</strong>：指令隐式地从操作数栈取数、把结果压回栈顶，因而编码紧凑、语义可直接推导。运行的基本单位是<strong>模块</strong>——由 Type、Code、Export、Memory 等段组成，且声明（函数签名）与定义（函数体）分离。模块的数据落在<strong>线性内存</strong>这块连续字节数组里，以 64KB 页为单位增长，JS 侧通过 <code>ArrayBuffer</code> 访问；间接调用则依赖<strong>函数表</strong>，在运行时按索引查表并校验签名。指令集本身只覆盖数值、内存、控制流与变量操作，且采用结构化控制流（无 goto），为可验证性提供基础。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"栈式虚拟机模型\">栈式虚拟机模型</h2><p>WebAssembly 采用栈式虚拟机（Stack Machine）作为计算模型。与寄存器机器不同，所有运算都通过操作数栈完成——指令从栈顶取操作数，将结果压回栈顶。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"wat\" data-code=\"(module&#10;  (func $add (param $a i32) (param $b i32) (result i32)&#10;    local.get $a    ;; 将参数 a 压栈&#10;    local.get $b    ;; 将参数 b 压栈&#10;    i32.add         ;; 弹出两个值，相加后压栈&#10;  )&#10;  (export &quot;add&quot; (func $add))&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(module</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (func $add (param $a i32) (param $b i32) (result i32)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    local.get $a    ;; 将参数 a 压栈</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    local.get $b    ;; 将参数 b 压栈</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    i32.add         ;; 弹出两个值，相加后压栈</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (export \"add\" (func $add))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>栈式机器（WASM）</th>\n<th>寄存器机器（x86/ARM）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>操作数位置</td>\n<td>隐式（栈顶）</td>\n<td>显式（寄存器名）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指令编码</td>\n<td>更紧凑（无寄存器字段）</td>\n<td>更长（含寄存器编号）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>验证难度</td>\n<td>简单（类型栈推导）</td>\n<td>复杂（寄存器分配）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行方式</td>\n<td>解释/JIT 编译为原生代码</td>\n<td>直接硬件执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二进制体积</td>\n<td>小（适合网络传输）</td>\n<td>大（含冗余编码）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 栈式执行流程&#10;        S1[栈: []&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;local.get $a (值=3)&quot;| S2[栈: [3]&quot;]&#10;        S2 --&gt;|&quot;local.get $b (值=5)&quot;| S3[栈: [3, 5]&quot;]&#10;        S3 --&gt;|&quot;i32.add&quot;| S4[栈: [8]&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 栈式执行流程\n        S1[栈: []\"] --&gt;|\"local.get $a (值=3)\"| S2[栈: [3]\"]\n        S2 --&gt;|\"local.get $b (值=5)\"| S3[栈: [3, 5]\"]\n        S3 --&gt;|\"i32.add\"| S4[栈: [8]\"]\n    end</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 虽然 WASM 规范定义的是栈式语义，但实际的引擎实现（如 V8 的 Liftoff/TurboFan）会将栈操作转换为寄存器分配，获得与原生代码相当的执行效率。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"模块结构\">模块结构</h2><p>WASM 模块是部署和加载的基本单位。一个模块由多个**段（Section）**组成，每个段承担特定职责。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    MODULE[WASM 模块] --&gt; TYPE[Type 段]&#10;    MODULE --&gt; IMPORT[Import 段]&#10;    MODULE --&gt; FUNC[Function 段]&#10;    MODULE --&gt; TABLE[Table 段]&#10;    MODULE --&gt; MEM[Memory 段]&#10;    MODULE --&gt; GLOBAL[Global 段]&#10;    MODULE --&gt; EXPORT[Export 段]&#10;    MODULE --&gt; START[Start 段]&#10;    MODULE --&gt; ELEM[Element 段]&#10;    MODULE --&gt; CODE[Code 段]&#10;    MODULE --&gt; DATA[Data 段]\">graph LR\n    MODULE[WASM 模块] --&gt; TYPE[Type 段]\n    MODULE --&gt; IMPORT[Import 段]\n    MODULE --&gt; FUNC[Function 段]\n    MODULE --&gt; TABLE[Table 段]\n    MODULE --&gt; MEM[Memory 段]\n    MODULE --&gt; GLOBAL[Global 段]\n    MODULE --&gt; EXPORT[Export 段]\n    MODULE --&gt; START[Start 段]\n    MODULE --&gt; ELEM[Element 段]\n    MODULE --&gt; CODE[Code 段]\n    MODULE --&gt; DATA[Data 段]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>段 ID</th>\n<th>段名称</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>必须</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>Type</td>\n<td>函数签名（参数与返回值类型）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>Import</td>\n<td>从宿主环境导入的函数/内存</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Function</td>\n<td>函数索引到类型索引的映射</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>Memory</td>\n<td>线性内存声明（初始/最大页数）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>Export</td>\n<td>导出给宿主的函数/内存/表</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>Code</td>\n<td>函数体的字节码</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>11</td>\n<td>Data</td>\n<td>内存初始化数据</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// Rust 中编译后的模块结构示意&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub fn fibonacci(n: u32) -&gt; u32 {&#10;    match n {&#10;        0 =&gt; 0,&#10;        1 =&gt; 1,&#10;        _ =&gt; fibonacci(n - 1) + fibonacci(n - 2),&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Rust 中编译后的模块结构示意</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn fibonacci(n: u32) -> u32 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    match n {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        0 => 0,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        1 => 1,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _ => fibonacci(n - 1) + fibonacci(n - 2),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"线性内存\">线性内存</h2><p>线性内存是 WASM 最重要的数据存储机制——一块连续的、可增长的字节数组，以 64KB（1 页）为单位分配。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"wat\" data-code=\"(module&#10;  (memory (export &quot;memory&quot;) 1 10)  ;; 初始 1 页，最大 10 页&#10;&#10;  (func $write (param $offset i32) (param $value i32)&#10;    local.get $offset&#10;    local.get $value&#10;    i32.store                      ;; 将 value 写入 offset 位置&#10;  )&#10;&#10;  (func $read (param $offset i32) (result i32)&#10;    local.get $offset&#10;    i32.load                       ;; 从 offset 位置读取 i32&#10;  )&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(module</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (memory (export \"memory\") 1 10)  ;; 初始 1 页，最大 10 页</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (func $write (param $offset i32) (param $value i32)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    local.get $offset</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    local.get $value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    i32.store                      ;; 将 value 写入 offset 位置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (func $read (param $offset i32) (result i32)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    local.get $offset</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    i32.load                       ;; 从 offset 位置读取 i32</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最小单位</td>\n<td>1 页 = 65536 字节（64KB）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地址空间</td>\n<td>32 位（最大 4GB），Memory64 提案支持 64 位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增长方式</td>\n<td><code>memory.grow</code> 指令，返回旧页数或 -1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>访问方式</td>\n<td>load/store 指令族（i32/i64/f32/f64）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边界检查</td>\n<td>运行时自动检查，越界触发 trap</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JS 侧访问</td>\n<td><code>WebAssembly.Memory</code> → <code>ArrayBuffer</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const memory = new WebAssembly.Memory({ initial: 1, maximum: 10 });&#10;const buffer = new Uint8Array(memory.buffer);&#10;buffer[0] = 42;&#10;memory.grow(1);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> memory</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WebAssembly.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ initial: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, maximum: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> buffer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Uint8Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(memory.buffer);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">buffer[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">memory.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">grow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 线性内存的 <code>ArrayBuffer</code> 在 <code>memory.grow</code> 后会被 detach。JS 侧持有的旧引用将失效，需要重新获取 <code>memory.buffer</code>。这是新手最常遇到的陷阱之一。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"函数表\">函数表</h2><p>函数表（Table）是 WASM 实现间接函数调用的机制，类似于 C 语言的函数指针数组。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"wat\" data-code=\"(module&#10;  (type $callback (func (param i32) (result i32)))&#10;  (table 2 funcref)&#10;&#10;  (func $double (param i32) (result i32)&#10;    local.get 0&#10;    i32.const 2&#10;    i32.mul)&#10;&#10;  (func $triple (param i32) (result i32)&#10;    local.get 0&#10;    i32.const 3&#10;    i32.mul)&#10;&#10;  (elem (i32.const 0) $double $triple)&#10;&#10;  (func $call_indirect (param $idx i32) (param $val i32) (result i32)&#10;    local.get $val&#10;    local.get $idx&#10;    call_indirect (type $callback))&#10;&#10;  (export &quot;call&quot; (func $call_indirect))&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(module</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (type $callback (func (param i32) (result i32)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (table 2 funcref)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (func $double (param i32) (result i32)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    local.get 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    i32.const 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    i32.mul)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (func $triple (param i32) (result i32)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    local.get 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    i32.const 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    i32.mul)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (elem (i32.const 0) $double $triple)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (func $call_indirect (param $idx i32) (param $val i32) (result i32)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    local.get $val</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    local.get $idx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    call_indirect (type $callback))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (export \"call\" (func $call_indirect))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    TABLE[&quot;函数表 (Table)&quot;] --&gt; IDX0[&quot;索引 0: $double&quot;]&#10;    TABLE --&gt; IDX1[&quot;索引 1: $triple&quot;]&#10;    CALL[&quot;call_indirect(idx=1, val=5)&quot;] --&gt; TABLE&#10;    TABLE --&gt;|&quot;idx=1&quot;| IDX1&#10;    IDX1 --&gt;|&quot;5 × 3&quot;| RESULT[&quot;返回 15&quot;]\">graph TD\n    TABLE[\"函数表 (Table)\"] --&gt; IDX0[\"索引 0: $double\"]\n    TABLE --&gt; IDX1[\"索引 1: $triple\"]\n    CALL[\"call_indirect(idx=1, val=5)\"] --&gt; TABLE\n    TABLE --&gt;|\"idx=1\"| IDX1\n    IDX1 --&gt;|\"5 × 3\"| RESULT[\"返回 15\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>直接调用（call）</th>\n<th>间接调用（call_indirect）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>目标函数</td>\n<td>编译时确定</td>\n<td>运行时通过索引查找</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型检查</td>\n<td>编译时验证</td>\n<td>运行时验证签名匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用场景</td>\n<td>普通函数调用</td>\n<td>回调、虚函数表、插件系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>更快（无查表开销）</td>\n<td>略慢（需查表+类型检查）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"指令集概览\">指令集概览</h2><p>WASM 指令集按功能分为数值运算、内存操作、控制流和变量操作四大类。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>指令示例</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数值运算</td>\n<td><code>i32.add</code>、<code>f64.mul</code>、<code>i32.clz</code></td>\n<td>整数/浮点算术与位操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存操作</td>\n<td><code>i32.load</code>、<code>f64.store</code>、<code>memory.grow</code></td>\n<td>线性内存读写与管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>控制流</td>\n<td><code>block</code>、<code>loop</code>、<code>if</code>、<code>br</code>、<code>return</code></td>\n<td>结构化控制流（无 goto）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变量操作</td>\n<td><code>local.get</code>、<code>global.set</code></td>\n<td>局部/全局变量读写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引用操作</td>\n<td><code>ref.null</code>、<code>ref.is_null</code>、<code>ref.func</code></td>\n<td>引用类型操作（新增）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SIMD</td>\n<td><code>v128.load</code>、<code>i32x4.add</code></td>\n<td>128 位 SIMD 向量运算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"wat\" data-code=\"(func $control_flow_example (param $n i32) (result i32)&#10;  (local $sum i32)&#10;  (local $i i32)&#10;  (local.set $i (i32.const 0))&#10;  (local.set $sum (i32.const 0))&#10;  (block $break&#10;    (loop $continue&#10;      (br_if $break (i32.ge_u (local.get $i) (local.get $n)))&#10;      (local.set $sum&#10;        (i32.add (local.get $sum) (local.get $i)))&#10;      (local.set $i&#10;        (i32.add (local.get $i) (i32.const 1)))&#10;      (br $continue)&#10;    )&#10;  )&#10;  (local.get $sum)&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(func $control_flow_example (param $n i32) (result i32)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (local $sum i32)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (local $i i32)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (local.set $i (i32.const 0))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (local.set $sum (i32.const 0))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (block $break</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (loop $continue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      (br_if $break (i32.ge_u (local.get $i) (local.get $n)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      (local.set $sum</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (i32.add (local.get $sum) (local.get $i)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      (local.set $i</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (i32.add (local.get $i) (i32.const 1)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      (br $continue)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (local.get $sum)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> WASM 采用结构化控制流——没有任意跳转的 goto 指令。所有分支目标必须是当前作用域的 <code>block</code>/<code>loop</code> 标签，这一设计保证了控制流图的可验证性和安全性。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((WASM 架构))&#10;    栈式虚拟机&#10;      操作数栈驱动&#10;      紧凑编码&#10;      可验证语义&#10;    模块结构&#10;      多段组成&#10;      Type/Code/Export&#10;      声明与定义分离&#10;    线性内存&#10;      连续字节数组&#10;      64KB 页为单位&#10;      JS 侧 ArrayBuffer&#10;    函数表&#10;      间接调用&#10;      运行时类型检查&#10;      回调与插件机制&#10;    指令集&#10;      四大类指令&#10;      结构化控制流&#10;      SIMD 扩展\">mindmap\n  root((WASM 架构))\n    栈式虚拟机\n      操作数栈驱动\n      紧凑编码\n      可验证语义\n    模块结构\n      多段组成\n      Type/Code/Export\n      声明与定义分离\n    线性内存\n      连续字节数组\n      64KB 页为单位\n      JS 侧 ArrayBuffer\n    函数表\n      间接调用\n      运行时类型检查\n      回调与插件机制\n    指令集\n      四大类指令\n      结构化控制流\n      SIMD 扩展</pre><ul>\n<li>WASM 采用<strong>栈式虚拟机</strong>模型，指令隐式操作栈顶元素，编码紧凑且易于验证。</li>\n<li>模块由多个<strong>段</strong>组成，Type 段定义签名、Code 段包含函数体、Export 段声明对外接口。</li>\n<li><strong>线性内存</strong>是一块连续字节数组，以 64KB 页为单位增长，JS 侧通过 <code>ArrayBuffer</code> 访问。</li>\n<li><strong>函数表</strong>实现间接调用，支持回调、虚函数表等动态分派场景，运行时验证类型签名。</li>\n<li>指令集覆盖数值运算、内存操作、控制流和变量操作，采用<strong>结构化控制流</strong>保证安全性。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"WASM 架构","id":"wasm-架构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"栈式虚拟机模型","id":"栈式虚拟机模型"},{"level":2,"text":"模块结构","id":"模块结构"},{"level":2,"text":"线性内存","id":"线性内存"},{"level":2,"text":"函数表","id":"函数表"},{"level":2,"text":"指令集概览","id":"指令集概览"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"类型系统与验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/core-concepts/type-system-and-validation"}}